---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { timeline } from "../data/timeline";
import { profile } from "../data/profile";
---

<Base title="About" description="About Damien Lo.">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1 class="page-title">About</h1>
    <div class="intro">
      <div>
        <p>
          Hi, I'm Damien, and thank you for visiting my site! I am originally from Hong Kong, and I now work as a research assistant
          with <a href="https://www.cs.emory.edu/~lxiong/">Professor Li Xiong</a> in the
          <a href="https://www.cs.emory.edu/site/aims/">AIMS Lab</a> at Emory University. I graduated from Emory in 2026
          with a B.S., majoring in Physics (Engineering Science Concentration) and in the Computer Science &amp; Economics
          Joint Program, the latter with Highest Honors.
        </p>
        <p>
          What has always driven my work is a simple wish to figure out how things work. That started with physics, and it
          has since grown into applying the same ideas and ways of reasoning to the complexity of modern machine learning
          models. I find that truly understanding a system opens pathways to new ideas that would otherwise stay hidden,
          and to me that is what research is fundamentally about.
        </p>
        <p>
          I am always happy to connect and talk through ideas, research or shared interests, so please feel free to
          <a href={`mailto:${profile.email}`}>reach out</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
      <figure class="photo">
        <img src="/about-photo.jpg" alt="Damien Lo, smiling" width="800" height="1000" loading="eager" />
      </figure>
    </div>

    <h2>Outside the lab</h2>
    <p>
      Away from research, I love making things with my hands. I build model aircraft and often design parts in CAD to 3D
      print, and I unwind by cooking. I have played football (soccer) and badminton since I was a kid, and I recently
      picked up boxing.
    </p>

    <h2>Timeline</h2>
    <ol class="timeline">
      {
        timeline.map((t) => (
          <li>
            <span class="when">{t.when}</span>
            <span>{t.what}</span>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ol>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .page-title { margin-top: 2.5rem; }
  .intro { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 210px; gap: 32px; align-items: start; }
  .intro p:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
  .photo { margin: 0.3rem 0 0; }
  .photo img { width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 10px; display: block; }
  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .intro { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 20px; }
    .photo { order: -1; max-width: 220px; }
  }
  .timeline { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; }
  .timeline li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 130px 1fr; gap: 14px; padding: 0.6rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .timeline li:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
  .when { color: var(--faint); font-size: 0.92rem; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; padding-top: 2px; }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .timeline li { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 0; }
  }
</style>
